{"id":"n60239-1-7","stage":1,"title":"글씨 · 字迹","scene":"书写与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60239-1-7-1","ko":"글씨가 참 깨알 같구나.","zh":"字写得也太小了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글씨가","meaning":"字迹","explanation":"글씨 指写出来的字迹；这里形容字像芝麻粒一样小。","readings":[{"term":"글씨","audio":"/audio/510fc81ede633cdb436d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60239","senseId":"1","lemma":"글씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글씨가","audio":"/audio/030f21a5f7736b954e42.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"깨알","meaning":"芝麻粒般小","explanation":"깨알 같다 把字比作芝麻粒，强调字非常小。","readings":[{"term":"깨알","audio":"/audio/69fe78eeb80d9e6d4631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26526","senseId":"1","lemma":"깨알","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깨알","audio":"/audio/69fe78eeb80d9e6d4631.mp3"}},{"text":"같구나.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같구나","audio":"/audio/684c36f117aba174a92d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"510fc81ede633cdb","term":"글씨","zh":"字迹","audio":"/audio/510fc81ede633cdb436d.mp3","entryId":"60239","definition":"写出来的字的形状；本句说字很小。","pronunciation":["글씨"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真、确实","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"在感叹句中加强程度，表示字真的很小。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"69fe78eeb80d9e6d","term":"깨알","zh":"芝麻粒","audio":"/audio/69fe78eeb80d9e6d4631.mp3","entryId":"26526","definition":"很小的芝麻籽；本句比喻字很小。","pronunciation":["깨알"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다"